{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/1536583-swarmflights","id":1536583,"title":"Swarmflights","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-05-30T13:40:15-07:00","id":1536583,"title":"Swarmflights","content":"For clarity, the reason for the following question is due to the fact that I base all my Changeling characters off of actual folkloric beings. have a question regarding Swarmflights from the Kith and Kin book. I was wondering if a Fairest/Swarmflight could theoretically disintegrate into a swarm of Pixies or if it has to be a mundane animal? If Pixies are possible would the Changelings Mask disguise her swarm form as well?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24961,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","user":"Darklander","date":".  Edited for clarity. 05-31-2024, 03:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24961-darklander","name":"Darklander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"102"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-05-30T13:44:39-07:00","id":1536584,"title":"","content":"Bubbles and will-o-wisps are given as examples of appropriate swarm constituents, so I'd certainly allow tiny fantastic creatures like pixies. I could see the swarm Mask going either way and honestly would probably just go with what the Storyteller and player agree they would prefer for that game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-n